{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "We Love Cookies admin: hosted-install endpoints",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "summary": "Public banner endpoints of the optional Cloudflare Worker admin.",
    "description": "Every endpoint lives on the origin that serves the script (the admin Worker). With a hosted install (`<script src=\".../welovecookies.min.js\" data-site=\"ws_...\">`) the script fetches `/api/consent/config?site=<key>` from the script's origin; the returned config carries absolute `endpoints.record` (`<origin>/api/consent`) and `endpoints.seen` (`<origin>/api/consent/seen`).\n\n## Own endpoint contract (without the admin)\n\nBuyers may set `endpoints.record` and/or `endpoints.seen` (or `data-record` / `data-seen`) to their own URLs. What the banner does (src/lib/consent/consent.ts):\n\n- **Request:** `POST <url>` with header `Content-Type: application/json` and a JSON body: `ConsentRecordPayload` for record (after every choice), `ConsentSeenPayload` for seen (at most once per page load, when a banner is shown). `site` is included only when the config has a site key. `page` is the path only.\n- **Same-origin URL** (relative, or starting with the page origin + `/`): `credentials: 'same-origin'`, `keepalive: true`. **Cross-origin URL:** `mode: 'cors'`, `credentials: 'omit'`, no keepalive; because of the JSON content type the browser sends a CORS preflight, so the endpoint must answer `OPTIONS` and send `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` (and allow the `content-type` header).\n- **Response:** the seen response is ignored. For record, only a 2xx response is parsed as JSON; if it has a `consent` object (`StoredConsent`) with the same `id` that differs from what the browser saved, the browser adopts it (rewrites the cookie, re-applies signals). Any other body is ignored.\n- **Failures never block the banner:** the banner closes and the cookie is written before the POST, which runs deferred; network errors, non-2xx and unparseable bodies are swallowed. If the hosted config fetch fails (non-2xx, network, or no string `mode`), the banner falls back to `{mode: 'auto', rev: 1, floatingButton: true, site}` (no endpoints) and logs nothing.\n\n## Admin limits\n\n- Request bodies over 8192 bytes (by `Content-Length` or while reading) or not a JSON object are treated as having no `site`, so they get **404**, not 413. `Content-Type` is not checked (no 415).\n- Optional per-IP rate limit via the `PUBLIC_LIMITER` binding (shipped wrangler.jsonc: 120 requests / 60 s, per Cloudflare location), keyed by path. When exceeded: 429 with `Retry-After: 60`, plain text, no CORS headers. OPTIONS is never limited. Without the binding there is no limit.\n- CORS: one exact origin per website, `Vary: Origin`, never credentials.",
    "license": {
      "name": "AGPL-3.0-only",
      "identifier": "AGPL-3.0-only"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://consent.example.com",
      "description": "Placeholder: the origin that serves welovecookies.min.js (your admin Worker)."
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Hosted install",
      "description": "Called cross-origin by the banner script on connected websites. See info.description for the contract your own `endpoints.record` / `endpoints.seen` must follow if you do not use the admin."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/consent/config": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "operationId": "getConsentConfig",
        "summary": "Config for one visitor of a connected website",
        "description": "Mode comes from Cloudflare's view of the visitor's connection (`request.cf` country/regionCode via regions.ts `modeFor`); missing location gives `opt-in`. `gpc` reflects the `Sec-GPC: 1` request header. The script calls this with `credentials: 'omit'`, `mode: 'cors'`.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "site",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteKey"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          },
          {
            "name": "Sec-GPC",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "`1` sets `gpc: true` in the response."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Config for this visitor.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HostedConsentConfig"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Site exists and is enabled but `Origin` is missing or not its exact origin. Body `{\"error\":\"Not allowed.\"}`. No CORS headers.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown/invalid site key or disabled website (`{\"error\":\"Unknown website.\"}`, no CORS headers), or the banner is switched off in settings (`{\"error\":\"Banner is off.\"}`, with CORS headers). The script then falls back to its built-in banner.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "Any other method.",
            "headers": {
              "Allow": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "GET, OPTIONS"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "summary": "CORS preflight for config",
        "description": "Answered only for the exact origin of an enabled connected website (looked up by the `Origin` header alone; no site key needed). Not rate limited. Never sends `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials`.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Origin belongs to an enabled website.",
            "headers": {
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "GET"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "content-type"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Max-Age": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "86400"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "No enabled website has this exact origin (or no `Origin` header). Empty body, no CORS headers."
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/consent": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "operationId": "recordConsent",
        "summary": "Record a visitor's choice (proof of consent)",
        "description": "The server decides `mode` (from the connection) and `rev` (the sent `rev` if it is an integer >= 1 and not above the site's current revision, else the current one); payload `mode` is ignored. GPC from the payload or `Sec-GPC: 1` forces `marketing: false`. `id` is kept if it matches `^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$`, else a new one is issued. `page` is stored as path only (same origin, max 200 chars); `landing` is not read. No IP address is stored; user agent is truncated to 200 chars.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          },
          {
            "name": "Sec-GPC",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "description": "JSON object, max 8192 bytes. Content-Type is not checked.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentRecordPayload"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Saved; `consent` is the server-corrected choice.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentRecordResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid choice (`{\"error\":\"Invalid choice.\"}`): bad action, grants, lang, device, page or gpc.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "`Origin` missing or not the site's exact origin (`{\"error\":\"Not allowed.\"}`). No CORS headers.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown, invalid or disabled site key, or body unreadable/over 8192 bytes/not a JSON object (`{\"error\":\"Not allowed.\"}`). No CORS headers.",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "Any other method.",
            "headers": {
              "Allow": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "POST, OPTIONS"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Database write failed (`{\"error\":\"Could not save.\"}`, with CORS headers), or an unexpected error (plain text, no CORS headers).",
            "headers": {
              "Cache-Control": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/NoStore"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "summary": "CORS preflight for record",
        "description": "Answered only for the exact origin of an enabled connected website (looked up by the `Origin` header alone; no site key needed). Not rate limited. Never sends `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials`.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Origin belongs to an enabled website.",
            "headers": {
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "POST"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "content-type"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Max-Age": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "86400"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "No enabled website has this exact origin (or no `Origin` header). Empty body, no CORS headers."
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/consent/seen": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "operationId": "countBannerView",
        "summary": "Count one banner view (cookieless aggregate)",
        "description": "Only `site` and `device` are read; the server derives mode and country from the connection. User agents matching `/bot|crawl|spider|slurp|headless|lighthouse|preview/i` are not counted (still 204). A failed count is logged and still answers 204.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "description": "JSON object, max 8192 bytes.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentSeenPayload"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Counted (or ignored as a bot).",
            "headers": {
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "`device` missing or not a valid Device. Empty body.",
            "headers": {
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "`Origin` missing or not the site's exact origin. Empty body, no CORS headers."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Unknown/invalid/disabled site key, or unreadable/oversized/non-object body. Empty body, no CORS headers."
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "Any other method.",
            "headers": {
              "Allow": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "POST, OPTIONS"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tags": [
          "Hosted install"
        ],
        "summary": "CORS preflight for seen",
        "description": "Answered only for the exact origin of an enabled connected website (looked up by the `Origin` header alone; no site key needed). Not rate limited. Never sends `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials`.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OriginHeader"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Origin belongs to an enabled website.",
            "headers": {
              "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/AllowOrigin"
              },
              "Vary": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/Vary"
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "POST"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "content-type"
                }
              },
              "Access-Control-Max-Age": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "86400"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "No enabled website has this exact origin (or no `Origin` header). Empty body, no CORS headers."
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "parameters": {
      "OriginHeader": {
        "name": "Origin",
        "in": "header",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "Must equal the connected website's stored origin exactly."
      }
    },
    "headers": {
      "AllowOrigin": {
        "description": "The connected website's exact origin.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        }
      },
      "Vary": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "Origin"
        }
      },
      "NoStore": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "private, no-store"
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "TooManyRequests": {
        "description": "Per-IP limit hit (only when `PUBLIC_LIMITER` is bound). Plain text, no CORS headers.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "const": "60"
            }
          },
          "Cache-Control": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "const": "no-store"
            }
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "text/plain": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ServerError": {
        "description": "Unexpected error: plain text `Something went wrong.`, no CORS headers.",
        "headers": {
          "Cache-Control": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "const": "no-store"
            }
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "text/plain": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "ConsentMode": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "opt-in",
          "opt-in-uk",
          "opt-in-light",
          "opt-out-gpc",
          "opt-out",
          "notice"
        ]
      },
      "ConsentAction": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "accept_all",
          "reject_all",
          "custom",
          "acknowledge",
          "withdraw",
          "gpc"
        ]
      },
      "Device": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "phone",
          "tablet",
          "desktop"
        ]
      },
      "SiteKey": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^ws_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{12}$"
      },
      "ConsentId": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$"
      },
      "Grants": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "preferences",
          "analytics",
          "marketing"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "preferences": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "analytics": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "marketing": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "StoredConsent": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "at",
          "mode",
          "rev",
          "grants",
          "action"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentId"
          },
          "at": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "ms since epoch"
          },
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentMode"
          },
          "rev": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "grants": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Grants"
          },
          "action": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentAction"
          }
        }
      },
      "ConsentRecordPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "action",
          "grants",
          "mode",
          "rev",
          "lang",
          "device",
          "gpc",
          "page"
        ],
        "description": "What the banner sends. The admin validates action, grants, lang, device, page (string <= 500), gpc (boolean if present) and requires `site`.",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Kept if 16 url-safe chars, else replaced."
          },
          "action": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentAction"
          },
          "grants": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Grants"
          },
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentMode",
            "description": "Ignored by the admin."
          },
          "rev": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "lang": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z]{2,3}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]{2,8})?$"
          },
          "device": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Device"
          },
          "gpc": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 500
          },
          "site": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteKey"
          },
          "landing": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Optional; not read by the admin."
          }
        }
      },
      "ConsentSeenPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "mode",
          "device",
          "lang"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentMode"
          },
          "device": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Device"
          },
          "lang": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "site": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteKey"
          }
        }
      },
      "ConsentRecordResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "ok",
          "consent"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "const": true
          },
          "consent": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StoredConsent"
          }
        }
      },
      "ConsentConfig": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "mode",
          "rev"
        ],
        "description": "Full browser config (types.ts). `mode` may be 'auto' in standalone use.",
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConsentMode"
              },
              {
                "const": "auto"
              }
            ]
          },
          "country": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "region": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "gpc": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "rev": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "lang": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "texts": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "description": "Overrides per language code; '*' for all."
          },
          "theme": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "bottom-left",
              "bottom-right",
              "bottom-center"
            ]
          },
          "preferencesCategory": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "floatingButton": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "noticeBanner": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "optOut",
              "notice"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "optOut": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "notice": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          },
          "cookies": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "provider",
                "category",
                "purpose",
                "duration"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "label": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "provider": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "category": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "purpose": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "duration": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
